{"game": "aliens-fireteam-elite", "language": "english", "appid": 1549970, "month": "2023-01", "window": 3, "start_date": 1673827200, "end_date": 1674518399, "month_true_total": 259, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-04 02:21:31 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "131392427", "author": {"steamid": "76561198378576726", "personaname": "Gwarf", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198378576726/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 9, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 9, "last_played": 1674442579, "avatar": "ae92fc2cc4ae7de2e192e5e2c34837c15f6c7447"}, "language": "english", "review": "No", "timestamp_created": 1674464880, "timestamp_updated": 1674464880, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "131366008", "author": {"steamid": "76561198046323743", "personaname": "pepper_bros", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198046323743/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 127, "playtime_forever": 2859, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2859, "last_played": 1721764487, "avatar": "1de7899d75ffe1047186a0e5f8e6ab73e8aaa096"}, "language": "english", "review": "After the rather meager games of recent years, this title from the Alien Universe surprised me ice-cold: level design, sound and the claustrophobic atmosphere have been successfully implemented, even the hordes of enemies are challenging in the higher level of difficulty.\n\nThe game is set in 2202, roughly two decades after the original film trilogy. As a member of the USCM Squad, we are first sent on a reconnaissance mission to the refinery surrounding the planet and then later to the surface of LV-895. Unsurprisingly, aliens have overrun everything both in orbit and on the planet itself, and it is up to us to stop the infestation...\n\nThe story fits well into the alien universe, but the tube-like levels are unfortunately not varied enough after a few walktroughs. A little more open world would have done the game good. The story does not come up with any big surprises. Here and there, a few Easter eggs can be spotted as well as references to the film series itself. If you are more into single player, there are still bots available in the story mode - but with the right squad mates at your side, the game is pretty enjoyable, even after walking through a couple of times.\n\nAltough nailing the look, sound and atmosphere of the Alien Universe, the game turns out to be way too short and the DLC comes along comparatively expensive, although it´s overall very well done. All in all, Fireteam Elite turns out to be a solid entertaining shooter for rainy afternoons.", "timestamp_created": 1674422182, "timestamp_updated": 1771343133, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "131360173", "author": {"steamid": "76561198055604967", "personaname": "Vallhund", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198055604967/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 16, "playtime_forever": 1513, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1188, "last_played": 1717681403, "avatar": "56b2c9e9a4948a35819b8f9ea2140fd95263cfc6"}, "language": "english", "review": "Fun game-play and very competent AI", "timestamp_created": 1674415773, "timestamp_updated": 1674415773, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.